{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_06",
  "title": "The Surrounded",
  "storyCode": "NL-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f130a0376de66aab500d8aa7c4317feca66b3203f1da896a8b2404fe546c5fef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 6-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Infected are making their move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They'll really charge through the front door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They'd better. The bigger their ruckus, the less we leave the Board to use against us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are things at the power plant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you doubting me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't dare."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can I kill Wild Mane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course... now that things have come to this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Roy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If we find ourselves some prey, that'll help make our owners less grumpy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're prey who got away to begin with... I'm just taking back what should've been mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Contact Team 3. Have them pack it up and come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wild Mane spotted! Wild—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Too slow, Armorless!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Urgh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pulling dirty tricks in the shadows... Don't tell me you people have forgotten how to take on a knight!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Filthy Infected!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is for Jamie and all the innocent who died by your hands!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eek—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Iwona! Don't forget what Sona said. Avoid killing anyone if you can... At the very least, when you kill them, make sure you're prepared to handle it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, you. Armorless... How many people have you killed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Trying to act all righteous now, are we? Hypocritical brat. Back when I was a bounty hunter on the Golden Prairie, I never gave a crap about that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you forgotten what life outside the cities is like? Those who stand at the top, the strongest survivors, are all cold-blooded bastards! That's the way it goes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Say whatever you want, but I've won."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When you've lost, when you're dead, nothing you say matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Armorless Union Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He probably sent out a distress signal just now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hopefully that'll lure the Armorless Union here. That'll make Greynuty's job easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fartooth, have you spotted any Armorless over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Greynuty's already in position. Just waiting on our signal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Szewczyk",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That said, the Armorless can't be this slow to react... Did Wild Mane really manage to lure them her way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She probably..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Armorless spotted. They're heading your way from an alleyway on 4th Street, Iwona!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Iwona...? Can you hear me? Iwona?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey?! Szewczyk? Iwona?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Justyna",
      "speakerToken": "avg_430_fartth_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The transmission... got cut? No way... In a city with this much transmission traffic...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This silence is creepy... Iwona. I have a bad feeling about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are those Armorless guys really such pushovers that we can take them down with an ambush?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bigger problem, I'm not getting any of Justyna's transmissions, and she should be staring down at us from somewhere up high right—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Shudder)—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All of a sudden, Iwona is overwhelmed with an aura so suffocating that it threatens to make her puke.\nShe isn't sure this is really a biological response. It could be some kind of toxin or an Arts effect.\nThen, a figure leaps down from the top of a tall tower.\nThe figure lands on the ground. The landing is silent as the veil lightly covering her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You jumped from so high up, but you didn't even let out a peep, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Must be nice to be a Feline."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Team 3..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?! When did they—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(The difference between these guys and the ones we fought just now are night and day... She's wearing blue. Is she the Lazurite from the other day?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You go on ahead..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You'd better survive this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aargh?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No way. I didn't even see her pull that bowstring—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Armorless Union operative in blue maintains her one-handed throwing posture.\nA hint of dissatisfaction comes through her cold expression. After all, this hunt started on an unlucky note."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She... threw it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "An Infected Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_221",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aghh! My leg. My leg!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Grit your teeth and keep running! Don't stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, stop looking around! I'm right here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you Infected all idiots? Look how many bows we have aimed at you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wild Mane Knight, you should be dead several days by now. Good on you, though. You still have the chance to play hero today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now run. I don't want this hunt to end on a such a boring note. Let's kill some time together."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah, you seem to be mistaken."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do I look like the kind of gal who hides in the shadows?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You look like the kind who's getting herself killed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Spit*. We Infected are sick of toiling our miserable lives away like that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're just a bunch of despicable bastards hiding behind the K.G.C.C., doing all kinds of shady business. Every one of us living out in the open is stronger than you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Remember their faces!\nRemember... These knights... These Kazimierzians... These cold-blooded murderers...\nDon't let them get away with it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Armorless scum..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you ever fought a gloompincer on the brink of death? Do you know how a dying, cornered animal fights?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're too full of yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I may die, but that doesn't mean I'll lose. And you. You'll pay your dues right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iwona",
      "speakerToken": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then... My friends will..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look at you. No fear of death on your face. You don't want to live, yet you still want to win. Ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The blue Armorless Union operative takes out an arrow from behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Monique",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
